    "name": "Mushroom Hunter World",
    "steam_appid": 3262810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/e280d38e3d44fa457c14efc3e971eea6.poster.avif?t=1748799740\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/e280d38e3d44fa457c14efc3e971eea6.webm?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/e280d38e3d44fa457c14efc3e971eea6.mp4?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the hustle and bustle of the city by walking through a picturesque forest. Enjoy nature, pick mushrooms and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of tranquility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest paths hide many secrets. Explore every corner, find rare species of mushrooms and become a true connoisseur of mycology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/2b3f255052bcd451d2daf3564e0ee242.poster.avif?t=1748799740\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/2b3f255052bcd451d2daf3564e0ee242.webm?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/2b3f255052bcd451d2daf3564e0ee242.mp4?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seven different locations with their unique places and vegetation, varied weather and mushroom picking conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 32 popular types of mushrooms with their own growing areas. Each mushroom has several stages of growth, its own unique quality level and weight.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various tasks, participate in festivals and mushroom picking competitions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your basket and knife to collect more mushrooms and get more experience and coins.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/e280d38e3d44fa457c14efc3e971eea6.poster.avif?t=1748799740\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/e280d38e3d44fa457c14efc3e971eea6.webm?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/e280d38e3d44fa457c14efc3e971eea6.mp4?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the hustle and bustle of the city by walking through a picturesque forest. Enjoy nature, pick mushrooms and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of tranquility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest paths hide many secrets. Explore every corner, find rare species of mushrooms and become a true connoisseur of mycology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/2b3f255052bcd451d2daf3564e0ee242.poster.avif?t=1748799740\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/2b3f255052bcd451d2daf3564e0ee242.webm?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262810/extras/2b3f255052bcd451d2daf3564e0ee242.mp4?t=1748799740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seven different locations with their unique places and vegetation, varied weather and mushroom picking conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 32 popular types of mushrooms with their own growing areas. Each mushroom has several stages of growth, its own unique quality level and weight.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various tasks, participate in festivals and mushroom picking competitions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your basket and knife to collect more mushrooms and get more experience and coins.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Go to the forest to collect as many mushrooms as possible! Will you be able to fill your basket to the brim? Develop your attentiveness, collect a variety of mushrooms and compete for the title of the best mushroom picker.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Russian, Japanese",
